            of finite type, having a differential that is the sum of a linear and a quadratic part, and for arrows the dgla morphisms that send generators to generators.
          %p The above remarks show
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition_2 Proposition
            %p
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
