                  %mi L
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi W
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ,
                  %mo ∂
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (L(W), \partial)
            be a dgla, that is, as a gla, free on a finite type vector space
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
